    <body>
      <p source="#source-508-531"><seg source="#source-508-531">ツツケンドンに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-531-577"><seg source="#source-531-577">女は言ひつぱなして出て行つた</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-577-606"><seg source="#source-577-606">襖の上に灰がみえる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-606-623"><seg source="#source-606-623">眼窩の顛倒</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-623-657"><seg source="#source-623-657">鳥の羽斜に空へ！……</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-657-686"><seg source="#source-657-686">対象の知れぬ寂しみ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-686-738"><seg source="#source-686-738">神様はつまらぬものゝみをつくつた</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-738-761"><seg source="#source-738-761">盥の底の残り水</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-761-781"><seg source="#source-761-781">古いゴムマリ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-781-815"><seg source="#source-781-815">十能が棄てられました</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-815-877"><seg source="#source-815-839">雀の声は何といふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-839-869"><rb>生唾液</rb><rt>ナマツバキ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-869-877">だ！</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-877-909"><seg source="#source-877-909">雨はまだ降るだらうか</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-909-996"><seg source="#source-909-936">インキ壺をのぞいて</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-936-978" corresp="#source-945-978"><seg source="#source-936-945">ニブリ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-978-996">加減をみよう</seg></p>
    </body>
